# Generated by the trailer's own scripts:
#   frames/     stills captured from the real app (node capture.mjs)
#   shots/      the recorded take, cut per shot (node record.mjs)
#   renders/    the encoded film
#   storyboard/ snapshot frames kept for review
#   .hyperframes/  the CLI's caches and check reports
#
# sfx/ is NOT ignored: the three samples are recorded assets, and a project that
# cannot find its own sound does not re-render. They are listed in ATTRIBUTION.md.
node_modules/
.hyperframes/
.transcode-cache/
frames/
shots/
renders/
storyboard/
.media/
.thumbnails/
